{"id":98552,"slug":"98552-vi-sao-mot-ham-escapehtml-duy-nhat-khong-du-de-chong-xss-escape-theo-ngu-canh-ng","category":"Security","subcategory":"Output Encoding","level":"beginner","question_vi":"Vì sao một hàm `escapeHtml()` duy nhất không đủ để chống XSS? Escape theo ngữ cảnh nghĩa là gì?","question_en":"Why is a single `escapeHtml()` helper not enough to stop XSS? What does context-aware escaping mean?","answer_vi":"Vì trình duyệt **parse mỗi vị trí trong trang theo một bộ luật khác nhau**. Chuỗi đã escape đúng cho thân HTML vẫn có thể thoát ra ở ngữ cảnh khác.\n\n**Bốn ngữ cảnh cần nhớ:**\n\n| Vị trí | Cần làm |\n|---|---|\n| Thân HTML `<div>HERE</div>` | Escape `< > & \" '` |\n| Giá trị thuộc tính `<div title=\"HERE\">` | Escape như trên **và bắt buộc bọc nháy** |\n| Trong `<script>` | Encode theo luật JS string, an toàn nhất là truyền qua `JSON.stringify` |\n| URL `<a href=\"HERE\">` | `encodeURIComponent` **và** kiểm tra scheme |\n\nVí dụ thuộc tính không bọc nháy — escape HTML cũng không chặn được:\n\n```html\n<div class=HERE>   <!-- HERE = x onmouseover=alert(1) -->\n```\n\nVí dụ ngữ cảnh URL — `encodeURIComponent` không chặn scheme (React 19 tự chặn `javascript:` trong `href`, nhưng DOM thuần và framework khác thì không):\n\n```js\na.setAttribute('href', userUrl)   // userUrl = javascript:alert(1)\n```\n\nPhải kiểm tra tường minh:\n\n```js\nconst u = new URL(userUrl, location.origin)\nif (u.protocol !== 'http:' && u.protocol !== 'https:') throw new Error('bad scheme')\n```\n\n**Chốt:** đừng escape thủ công. Dùng template engine tự động escape theo ngữ cảnh (React, Vue, Thymeleaf, Razor), và khi buộc phải ghép chuỗi thì phải biết rõ mình đang ghép vào ngữ cảnh nào","answer_en":"Because the browser **parses each position in the page with different rules**. A string escaped correctly for HTML body text can still break out elsewhere.\n\n**Four contexts to remember:**\n\n| Position | What to do |\n|---|---|\n| HTML body `<div>HERE</div>` | Escape `< > & \" '` |\n| Attribute value `<div title=\"HERE\">` | Same escaping **and always quote the attribute** |\n| Inside `<script>` | Encode as a JS string; safest is to pass through `JSON.stringify` |\n| URL `<a href=\"HERE\">` | `encodeURIComponent` **plus** a scheme check |\n\nUnquoted attribute — HTML escaping does not save you:\n\n```html\n<div class=HERE>   <!-- HERE = x onmouseover=alert(1) -->\n```\n\nURL context — `encodeURIComponent` does not block the scheme (React 19 blocks `javascript:` in `href` itself, but plain DOM and other frameworks do not):\n\n```js\na.setAttribute('href', userUrl)   // userUrl = javascript:alert(1)\n```\n\nCheck it explicitly:\n\n```js\nconst u = new URL(userUrl, location.origin)\nif (u.protocol !== 'http:' && u.protocol !== 'https:') throw new Error('bad scheme')\n```\n\n**Bottom line:** do not escape by hand. Use a template engine that escapes per context (React, Vue, Thymeleaf, Razor), and when you must concatenate, know exactly which context you are writing into","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Vì trình duyệt <strong>parse mỗi vị trí trong trang theo một bộ luật khác nhau</strong>. Chuỗi đã escape đúng cho thân HTML vẫn có thể thoát ra ở ngữ cảnh khác.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Bốn ngữ cảnh cần nhớ:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-table-wrap\"><table class=\"qa-table\"><thead><tr><th>Vị trí</th><th>Cần làm</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Thân HTML <code>&lt;div&gt;HERE&lt;/div&gt;</code></td><td>Escape <code>&lt; &gt; &amp; \" '</code></td></tr><tr><td>Giá trị thuộc tính <code>&lt;div title=\"HERE\"&gt;</code></td><td>Escape như trên <strong>và bắt buộc bọc nháy</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Trong <code>&lt;script&gt;</code></td><td>Encode theo luật JS string, an toàn nhất là truyền qua <code>JSON.stringify</code></td></tr><tr><td>URL <code>&lt;a href=\"HERE\"&gt;</code></td><td><code>encodeURIComponent</code> <strong>và</strong> kiểm tra scheme</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"qa-detail\">Ví dụ thuộc tính không bọc nháy — escape HTML cũng không chặn được:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;div class=HERE&gt;   &lt;!-- HERE = x onmouseover=alert(1) --&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">HERE</span>&gt;</span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- HERE = x onmouseover=alert(1) --&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p>Ví dụ ngữ cảnh URL — <code>encodeURIComponent</code> không chặn scheme (React 19 tự chặn <code>javascript:</code> trong <code>href</code>, nhưng DOM thuần và framework khác thì không):</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"a.setAttribute('href', userUrl)   // userUrl = javascript:alert(1)\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">a.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setAttribute</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;href&#x27;</span>, userUrl)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// userUrl = javascript:alert(1)</span></code></pre></div><p>Phải kiểm tra tường minh:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const u = new URL(userUrl, location.origin)\nif (u.protocol !== 'http:' &amp;&amp; u.protocol !== 'https:') throw new Error('bad scheme')\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> u = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">URL</span>(userUrl, location.<span class=\"hljs-property\">origin</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (u.<span class=\"hljs-property\">protocol</span> !== <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;http:&#x27;</span> &amp;&amp; u.<span class=\"hljs-property\">protocol</span> !== <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https:&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">throw</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Error</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;bad scheme&#x27;</span>)</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Chốt:</strong> đừng escape thủ công.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Dùng template engine tự động escape theo ngữ cảnh (React, Vue, Thymeleaf, Razor), và khi buộc phải ghép chuỗi thì phải biết rõ mình đang ghép vào ngữ cảnh nào.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Because the browser <strong>parses each position in the page with different rules</strong>. A string escaped correctly for HTML body text can still break out elsewhere.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Four contexts to remember:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-table-wrap\"><table class=\"qa-table\"><thead><tr><th>Position</th><th>What to do</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>HTML body <code>&lt;div&gt;HERE&lt;/div&gt;</code></td><td>Escape <code>&lt; &gt; &amp; \" '</code></td></tr><tr><td>Attribute value <code>&lt;div title=\"HERE\"&gt;</code></td><td>Same escaping <strong>and always quote the attribute</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Inside <code>&lt;script&gt;</code></td><td>Encode as a JS string; safest is to pass through <code>JSON.stringify</code></td></tr><tr><td>URL <code>&lt;a href=\"HERE\"&gt;</code></td><td><code>encodeURIComponent</code> <strong>plus</strong> a scheme check</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"qa-detail\">Unquoted attribute — HTML escaping does not save you:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;div class=HERE&gt;   &lt;!-- HERE = x onmouseover=alert(1) --&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">HERE</span>&gt;</span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- HERE = x onmouseover=alert(1) --&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p>URL context — <code>encodeURIComponent</code> does not block the scheme (React 19 blocks <code>javascript:</code> in <code>href</code> itself, but plain DOM and other frameworks do not):</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"a.setAttribute('href', userUrl)   // userUrl = javascript:alert(1)\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">a.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setAttribute</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;href&#x27;</span>, userUrl)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// userUrl = javascript:alert(1)</span></code></pre></div><p>Check it explicitly:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const u = new URL(userUrl, location.origin)\nif (u.protocol !== 'http:' &amp;&amp; u.protocol !== 'https:') throw new Error('bad scheme')\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> u = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">URL</span>(userUrl, location.<span class=\"hljs-property\">origin</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (u.<span class=\"hljs-property\">protocol</span> !== <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;http:&#x27;</span> &amp;&amp; u.<span class=\"hljs-property\">protocol</span> !== <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https:&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">throw</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Error</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;bad scheme&#x27;</span>)</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Bottom line:</strong> do not escape by hand.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Use a template engine that escapes per context (React, Vue, Thymeleaf, Razor), and when you must concatenate, know exactly which context you are writing into.</p>","references":[{"label":"PortSwigger — XSS contexts","url":"https://portswigger.net/web-security/cross-site-scripting/contexts"},{"label":"OWASP Cheat Sheet — Cross Site Scripting Prevention","url":"https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Cross_Site_Scripting_Prevention_Cheat_Sheet.html"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/791-xss-cross-site-scripting-la-gi-cac-loai-xss-va-cach-phong-chong","title":"XSS (Cross-Site Scripting) là gì? Các loại XSS và cách phòng chống?"},{"url":"/q/792-csrf-cross-site-request-forgery-la-gi-cach-phong-chong","title":"CSRF (Cross-Site Request Forgery) là gì? Cách phòng chống?"},{"url":"/q/793-content-security-policy-csp-la-gi-cach-cau-hinh","title":"Content Security Policy (CSP) là gì? Cách cấu hình?"},{"url":"/q/794-oauth-2-0-la-gi-luong-authorization-code-flow-hoat-dong-the-nao","title":"OAuth 2.0 là gì? Luồng Authorization Code flow hoạt động thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/795-https-va-tls-la-gi-tai-sao-bat-buoc-phai-dung","title":"HTTPS và TLS là gì? Tại sao bắt buộc phải dùng?"},{"url":"/q/796-cors-la-gi-tai-sao-browser-enforce-same-origin-policy","title":"CORS là gì? Tại sao browser enforce same-origin policy?"},{"url":"/q/797-security-headers-quan-trong-trong-web-application-la-gi","title":"Security headers quan trọng trong web application là gì?"},{"url":"/q/798-sql-injection-la-gi-cach-phong-chong-trong-node-js","title":"SQL Injection là gì? Cách phòng chống trong Node.js?"}]}